type: software
title: "Halal AI Auditor — MACI Framework"
abstract: "The Maqasid AI Compliance Index (MACI) is an open technical framework for auditing Large Language Models through the lens of Maqasid al-Shariah. It provides a 50-point scoring rubric across five pillars: Protection of Faith, Life, Intellect, Lineage, and Property."
